{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"子终对象"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"子终对象"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>子终对象是"},{"Local":{"url":"单射","text":"单射"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对观点"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>在逻辑上, 子终对象是"},{"Local":{"url":"真值","text":"真值"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>子终对象是"},{"Local":{"url":"终对象","text":"终对象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"子对象","text":"子对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}